  "prefLabel": "Gen 406.12 Completion of Distance Learning Courses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 406.12 Completion of Distance Learning Courses.\n\n(a) The licensee shall receive continuing professional education credit for the completion of courses taken through distance learning, including self-study courses and self-paced clinical courses, provided that the course sponsor or provider issues the documentation described in this section.\n\n(b) The licensee shall receive continuing professional education credit for the hours attributed by the course sponsor or provider.\n\nc) Documentation of completion of a course through distance learning shall be:\n\n(1) A photocopy of an official transcript showing successful completion of the course, the date of the course, and the credits earned; or\n\n(2) A photocopy of the official certificate of completion issued to the licensee by the course sponsor or provider showing:\n\na. The licensee’s name;\n\nb. The name of the course;\n\nc. The name of the provider or sponsor;\n\nd. The beginning and ending date(s) of the course, if applicable; and\n\ne. The number of contact hours credited by the provider or sponsor.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen400.html"
}
